# Windows shells choke on LF-only scripts in ways that are hard to diagnose
# (a label or a caret continuation silently mis-parses), so these two are
# checked out with CRLF regardless of platform. Everything else is normalised
# to LF in the repository and left to git's own detection on checkout.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf
